# React SPA Rules

- Use component architecture with clear responsibility boundaries.
- Build reusable UI primitives before one-off components.
- Avoid inline styles; use design system tokens/classes.
- Organize by feature modules, not only technical layers.
- Use lazy loading and route-level splitting where sensible.
- Ensure mobile responsiveness.
- Maintain accessibility support (semantic HTML, labels, keyboard usage).
- Support dynamic theming via centralized tokens/context.
